Package: bixverse.gpu
Title: 
    GPU-accelerated methods via cubecl and WGPU for the bixverse with general
    methods such as k-means and correlations and a lot of methods specific for
    single cell analysis acceleration.
Version: 0.7.0
Authors@R: 
    person(
        given = "Gregor", 
        family = "Lueg", 
        email = "gregorlueg@me.com", 
        role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: 
    Provides GPU-accelerated methods for the bixverse. These run on Burn,
    cubecl and wgpu, so they work across GPU vendors, with an opt-in MLX backend
    on Apple Silicon.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
